<title>INDONESIA: Jakarta stock market closed on Friday for holiday.</title>
<headline>Jakarta stock market closed on Friday for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Jakarta stock exchange is closed on Friday for the Moslem Eid al-Fitr holiday.</p>
<p>The Jakarta Composite Index rose 7.42 points, or 1.08 percent, to close at 694.28 points on Thursday after falling to 685.74 points in early trade.</p>
<p>The market reopens on Wednesday February 12.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
